    <string name="credits_content">Conceito e Ícone: Marc Napitupulu\n\n[GitHub](https://github.com/marcdroid) | [Website](https://justamarc.wordpress.com/)\n\n• [Jetpack Compose](https://developer.android.com/compose)\n• [Kotlin Coroutines](https://kotlinlang.org/docs/coroutines-overview.html)\n• [Material 3](https://m3.material.io)</string>
